---
title: "publishSaleResults (LegionSealedBidAuctionSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: check caller is Legion operator
    q_check_auth --> q_check_initialized: authorized
    q_check_auth --> q_revert: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_initialized --> q_check_not_published: initializePublishSaleResults called
    q_check_initialized --> q_revert: revert NotInitialized
    q_check_not_published --> q_validate_key: results not yet published
    q_check_not_published --> q_revert: revert AlreadyPublished
    q_validate_key --> q_set_merkle: privateKey corresponds to stored publicKey
    q_validate_key --> q_revert: revert InvalidPrivateKey
    q_set_merkle --> q_set_totals: set claimMerkleRoot, excessMerkleRoot
    q_set_totals --> q_store_key: set totalAcceptedCapital, totalTokensAllocated
    q_store_key --> [*]: store privateKey, emit ResultsPublished
    q_revert --> [*]: revert with error

    note right of q_validate_key
        INV-001: privateKey must derive the stored publicKey
        INV-002: private key release enables public bid verification
    end note

    note right of q_set_merkle
        INV-003: Merkle roots immutable once published
        INV-004: totalAcceptedCapital <= totalInvestedCapital
        INV-005: publication requires prior initializePublishSaleResults call
    end note
